<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 15 bln SKR worth 7-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 15 bln SKR worth 7-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of seven-day Treasury bills worth 15 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on April 9. All bids must be received by 0900 GMT on April 8.</p>
<p>The paper will run from April 9 and mature on April 16.</p>
<p>The lowest accepted bid volume is 100 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
